{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57589","headline":"太上智慧徊玄经颂一章 · 无名氏","name":"太上智慧徊玄经颂一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵仙乘庆霄，驾龙蹑玄波。\n洽真表嘉祥，濯足八天河。\n福应不我期，故能释天罗。\n道德冠三界，地网亦以过。\n感遇灵真会，净慧经莲华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}